X_SgQ7kNvwGWtzHQ&_nc_oc=AdqLe9c2ARA3Q7hueQJUnJ4FggNT__iJ3xS7uBfSKyXkIxZWPnuQrHmfqWsbuZgwyMU&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLjvGOBJpvaHLhMTdatLhNPvzY1mPge-c4ZDVvnXypMPw&oe=6AAE9F2D"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "2603779376744141", "uri": "https://scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499313074_2603779380077474_4666028558694902990_n.png?_nc_cat=102&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=a8HQaVtbp4sQ7kNvwHbQUt3&_nc_oc=Ado7jX1Njiu_i0Mbug_hjAIud8ccgNIQjchY9pG09Db7eXjsDCukjJqogTdgLR_Wy0E&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin2-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLLTu3B96o9X3nhq6HrUNVxC-8aqB9KtxzdEI3kxBv1DQ&oe=6AAE8183"}, {"file_name": "4.png", "id": "1978053772849249", "uri": "https://scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499311597_1978053776182582_2907804030611711830_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=lOikx2EmgnUQ7kNvwGuZLUd&_nc_oc=Adq1D5cSDR7YlZSHPmR6pT98QQz0TppP_8Nk3eF3bPBkrqnktjxry30VbwFtFL7rCXs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin11-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQIUsU_mO92K-SdS_pEzUaj1FbyLpCvFiQJZl9v6cf_z6Q&oe=6AAE9653"}, {"file_name": "cap2.png", "id": "2479962425803629", "uri": "https://scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499312422_2479962429136962_4316597219347806467_n.png?_nc_cat=109&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=skp8q-ZCrUUQ7kNvwHi5JgZ&_nc_oc=AdqlxnzFAGBoiK06RfchKFV9I5Y44n55mryCJF8Sx6UUgVWxHQsinzU83s7jUIqH1-g&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sin6-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQJhZteO89blAO_QNTnWWAxjTLHaMe7b-khFQ7UedCaISw&oe=6AAEAB26"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "bodyPress", "keywords": [], "long_description": "Your body writes a journal every day \u2014 BodyPress reads it.\n\nBodyPress turns your health data into a daily first-person story. Instead of staring at numbers and charts, you read a warm, insightful narrative written as if your body is speaking to you \u2014 revealing patterns and correlations you'd otherwise miss.\n\n\u26a0\ufe0f HEALTH NOTICE\nBodyPress is a general wellness and self-reflection tool. It is NOT a medical device and does NOT provide medical advice, diagnosis, or treatment. Always consult a qualified healthcare professional for any questions about your health or a medical condition. Never disregard or delay professional medical advice because of anything you read in this app. In an emergency, contact your doctor or emergency services immediately.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\u2728 WHY BODYPRESS\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\nMost health apps show dashboards of disconnected metrics. BodyPress takes a storytelling approach: it gathers data from your sensors, wearables, and environment, then uses AI to weave it into one cohesive narrative. Poor sleep before an elevated resting heart rate? Cleaner-air days with fewer steps? Your body knows \u2014 and now it can tell you.\n\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83c\udfaf KEY FEATURES\n\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\u2501\n\ud83d\udcd6 AI DAILY JOURNAL\n\u2022 First-person narratives from real sensor data\n\u2022 Headline, mood, summary, and full story\n\n\ud83d\udcca DATA COLLECTION\n\u2022 Health: steps, distance, calories, heart rate, HRV, sleep, workouts\n\u2022 Environment: temperature, air quality (AQI), UV, humidity, weather\n\u2022 Locatio", "short_description": "BodyPress turns your health data into a daily first-person story. Instead of staring at numbers and charts, you read a warm, insightful narrative written as if your body is speaking to you \u2014 revealing patterns and correlations you'd otherwise miss."}]}, "developer_name": null, "dev